{"id":"n30201-1-19","stage":1,"title":"허리 · 腰","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n30201-1-19-1","ko":"허리가 너무 아파요.","zh":"我的腰太疼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"허리가","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리가","audio":"/audio/ce5c6c7b6a73dfaf9320.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"아파요.","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아파요","audio":"/audio/0d77fc96982cfc284c03.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e82a72e160fe8f1a747b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n30201-1-19-2","ko":"구부정한 자세로 책상에 앉아 있으니 그렇지.","zh":"因为是弯着腰坐在桌子前，所以才会这样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"구부정한","meaning":"微驼","explanation":"구부정하다：微驼；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"구부정하다","audio":"/audio/637c46b262509e77f78b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35054","senseId":"1","lemma":"구부정하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구부정한","audio":"/audio/87e11cc7a02c382fce04.mp3"}},{"text":"자세로","meaning":"姿势，姿态","explanation":"자세：姿势，姿态；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"자세","audio":"/audio/8cc096f62a2aeac2c96a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24780","senseId":"1","lemma":"자세","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자세로","audio":"/audio/af5bf140a75449753955.mp3"}},{"text":"책상에","meaning":"书桌","explanation":"책상：书桌；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"책상","audio":"/audio/e2d1cb559455849bf57e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72039","senseId":"1","lemma":"책상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"책상에","audio":"/audio/857c9dcfc1b6ee935b30.mp3"}},{"text":"앉아","meaning":"坐","explanation":"앉다：坐；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"앉다","audio":"/audio/17e77d3fb6b2dbdb6258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71463","senseId":"1","lemma":"앉다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"앉아","audio":"/audio/709a1afa79c56d9a698a.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으니","audio":"/audio/ef60efcf38deedc61094.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇지.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇지","audio":"/audio/66da57bd505cc1e1c679.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"637c46b262509e77","term":"구부정하다","zh":"微驼","audio":"/audio/637c46b262509e77f78b.mp3","entryId":"35054","definition":"身板不直，稍微弯曲。","pronunciation":["구부정하다"]